    "purpose": "The least common multiple is useful in various mathematical and real-world applications, such as finding the smallest number that is a multiple of two or more numbers.",
    "primary_function": "lcm",
    "code": "def gcd(a, b):\n    while b:\n        a, b = b, a % b\n    return a\n\ndef lcm(*args):\n    result = args[0]\n    for num in args[1:]:\n        result = result * num // gcd(result, num)\n    return result",
